        Before quantum physics theorized that observing a particle changes its behavior, the Alexandrian Hermeticists had already mapped the underlying architecture of the matrix. Their conclusion was absolute: <em>The Universe is Mental.</em> Physical matter is not the foundation of reality; it is a secondary, low-resolution projection generated by the Divine Mind, or <strong>The Nous</strong>.
      </p>
